     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi! <br><br>How can I read the united DB files back into R? The files were compressed and .tabix ed. I&#39;m dealing with huge WGBS files so it would be great to skip the ~1h that it takes for pre-processing. Found a similar problem here <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/methylkit_discussion/okK5qJkjQa0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!topic/methylkit_discussion/okK5qJkjQa0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232341959000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ub-y5wI1Yc2FnCUC35jLd\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/methylkit_discussion/okK5qJkjQa0</a> , the solution works when everything is stored in separate files (up to filtering) but after using the `union` function things are stored as 1 file which I cannot read back into R  <br><br>Thanks! Cheers, Fabian<br><br>Example:<br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;extdata&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test1.myCpG.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;methylKit&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;extdata&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test2.myCpG.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;methylKit&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;extdata&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;control1.myCpG.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;methylKit&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;extdata&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;control2.myCpG.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;methylKit&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>myobj </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> methRead</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ctrl1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ctrl2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  assembly</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hg18&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">treatment</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">f </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> filterByCoverage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">count</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">perc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                           hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">count</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">perc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">99.9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> save</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">db </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> F</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fu </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unite</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> destrand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> save</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">db </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  db</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dir </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test_DB&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">## Does not work!</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>re </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> methRead</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">location </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test_DB/test1_test2_ctrl1_ctrl2.txt.bgz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ctrl1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ctrl2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               assembly</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hg18&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">treatment</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               dbtype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tabix&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></span><br><br></div>"
