     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>The earlier problem you found actually related to the reading of initial data (methylRawDB), not intermediate, like methylBaseDB. <br>But, we are currently working on new features, which are not yet available, to make reading and writing of the tabix objects easier.   <br><br></div><div>So if you have the latest version of methylKit from GitHub (v1.3.3), then you could use this code to load for example the data inside a tabix file: <br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">methylKit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">readMethylBaseDB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dbpath </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> methylBaseDB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">obj@dbpath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                             dbtype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tabix&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ids </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> methylBaseDB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">obj@sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ids</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                             </span></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">assembly </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> methylBaseDB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">obj@sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ids</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> context </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> methylBaseDB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">obj@context</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                             </span></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">resolution </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> methylBaseDB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">obj@resolution</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> treatment </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                             </span></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">destranded </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> methylBaseDB</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">obj@destranded</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>If you have any questions related to the function call please ask. </div><div><br></div> </div><div>Please note: </div><div>This function is not exported and probably will never be, this is why you have to call it like this &#39;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">methylKit</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:::</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">readMethylBaseDB&#39;. </span></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Alex<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div> <br>Am Donnerstag, 17. August 2017 10:07:31 UTC+2 schrieb <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">fabian....@gmail.com</a>:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi! <br><br>How can I read the united DB files back into R? The files were compressed and .tabix ed. I&#39;m dealing with huge WGBS files so it would be great to skip the ~1h that it takes for pre-processing. Found a similar problem here <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/methylkit_discussion/okK5qJkjQa0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!topic/methylkit_discussion/okK5qJkjQa0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232341964000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pV66a4XzBK-OoryMRauBU\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/methylkit_discussion/okK5qJkjQa0</a> , the solution works when everything is stored in separate files (up to filtering) but after using the `union` function things are stored as 1 file which I cannot read back into R  <br><br>Thanks! Cheers, Fabian<br><br>Example:<br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;extdata&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test1.myCpG.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;methylKit&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;extdata&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test2.myCpG.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;methylKit&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;extdata&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;control1.myCpG.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;methylKit&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  system</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;extdata&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;control2.myCpG.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package